    "Shows a one-tap chip on inbox rows and a suggested list while you type. The model trains locally on your history and never leaves your device." : {

    },
    "Shows today at a glance, above the layout. Dial is a 24-hour clock with your logs as dots and sleep as an arc, lit by the real sunrise and sunset for your time zone — no location needed. Timeline shows the same day as a horizontal strip." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
