    "When on, other members can see your username, display name, and bio. When off, your contributions appear without a public profile." : {

    },
    "When on, pending items in the source list import automatically and are removed from Reminders. Runs on app launch and whenever Reminders changes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
