      }
    },
    "Where your data lives" : {

    },
    "Whether weights, distances, and fluids show in metric (kg, km, ml) or imperial (lb, mi, fl oz) across Training, Body, and Hydration. Your data is always stored the same way — this only changes how it’s displayed and entered." : {

